### Module 3: Location and Nearby Assistance
Integrate Google Maps Platform.

Implement:
- Current-location detection with permission handling.
- Manual location selection.
- Map markers for registered fuel outlets and assistance providers.
- Search for suitable nearby assistance.
- Route and distance estimates when the required Google Maps services are enabled.
