Generate a QR code associated with a registered vehicle or vehicle record. Scanning it should retrieve the appropriate vehicle identification information after authorization.

Do not encode passwords, JWTs, personal contact information, or other sensitive data directly in the QR code.

Use an opaque identifier or signed, limited-purpose reference. Enforce backend authorization and protect against unauthorized vehicle-data access.

